{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0294","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:0000011b:text","row":39373,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"友貴が、廊下側に張り出したカムフラージュを直していた。","en":"Tomoki was fixing the camouflage he'd hung on the hallway side.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904081","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00001","en":"Tomoki was mending the camouflage posted towards the corridor.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000171:text","row":39374,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「おーい」","en":"“Heeey.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904082","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00002","en":"Taichi: \"Heeey.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000219:text","row":39375,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"「う、太一……」","en":"“Uh, Taichi...”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904083","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00003","en":"Tomoki: \"Oh, Taichi...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000241:text","row":39376,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"気恥ずかしげに、窓際から離れる。","en":"Looking embarrassed, he stepped away from the window.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904084","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00004","en":"Seeming ashamed, he distances himself from the window.","verdict":"questionable","categories":["word_choice","register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000279:text","row":39377,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"部室類は、廊下側にも窓がはめ込まれている。","en":"Clubrooms had windows set into their hallway walls, too.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904085","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00005","en":"Our club room has windows inlaid in the wall towards the corridor,","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","grammar"],"assessment":"The Japanese generalizes that club rooms of this type have corridor-facing windows. The English narrows the plural class to one possessive room.","remedy":"The club rooms have windows","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":25,"start":0,"text":"Our club room has windows"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:000002bb:text","row":39378,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"外から監視できるようにだ。","en":"So they could be watched from outside.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904086","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00006","en":"so that surveillance is possible from the outside if required.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:000002ed:text","row":39379,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"理由は推して知るべし。","en":"The reason went without saying.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904087","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00007","en":"The reason is easy to guess.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000323:text","row":39380,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"「……直したって意味ないんじゃ？」","en":"“...Is there any point in fixing that?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904088","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00008","en":"Taichi: \"...but fixing this's meaningless, innit?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:000003e3:text","row":39381,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"「気になってさ。特に意味はないよ」","en":"“It was bothering me. No real reason.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904089","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00009","en":"Tomoki: \"It just bothered me. Doesn't have to have meaning.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["logical_relation","mistranslation"],"assessment":"Tomoki states that fixing it has no special meaning. The English instead says meaningfulness is not required, leaving open that it may have meaning.","remedy":"There isn't any special meaning to it.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":59,"start":30,"text":"Doesn't have to have meaning."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:0000041d:text","row":39382,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"意味はない、か。","en":"No reason, huh.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904090","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00010","en":"Meaningless indeed, then.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000445:text","row":39383,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"確かにそうだ。実質的には。","en":"True enough, in practical terms.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904091","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00011","en":"Certainly that is true... in the practical sense.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000477:text","row":39384,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"けど心の上では？","en":"But emotionally?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904092","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00012","en":"But what about in the heart?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000525:text","row":39385,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「しっかし、本当に誰もいないね」","en":"“There really is nobody here.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904093","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00013","en":"Tomoki: \"But really, there's seriously nobody.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000565:text","row":39386,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「ああ、本当に八人だけみたいだ」","en":"“Yeah. Looks like it's just the eight of us.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904094","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00014","en":"Taichi: \"Yep, it really looks like it's just us eight.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:000005c2:text","row":39387,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"「なにがなにやら……」","en":"“I don't know what to make of any of this...”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904095","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00015","en":"Tomoki: \"Something happened who knows what...\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","idiom_calque"],"assessment":"The idiom means he has no idea what is going on. The English combines an assertion and embedded question without a grammatical relation.","remedy":"I have no idea what's going on...","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":45,"start":9,"text":"Something happened who knows what..."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:000005f0:text","row":39388,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"友貴は、みみ先輩を恨んでいるんだったな。","en":"Right. Tomoki resented Mimi.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904096","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00016","en":"Tomoki was bearing a grudge on Mimi-senpai,","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar"],"assessment":"The idiomatic preposition is 'against,' not 'on.'","remedy":"a grudge against Mimi-senpai","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":42,"start":19,"text":"a grudge on Mimi-senpai"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000630:text","row":39389,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"実の姉弟なのに。","en":"Even though she was his biological older sister.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904097","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00017","en":"despite how they're blood-related siblings.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000658:text","row":39390,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"苗字が違うのは、いろいろ事情があるらしい。","en":"Apparently there were all sorts of circumstances behind their different last names.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904098","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00018","en":"As to why their last name is different, there seem to circumstances of all sorts.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar"],"assessment":"The existential construction is missing the verb 'be.'","remedy":"there seem to be all sorts of circumstances","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":67,"start":40,"text":"there seem to circumstances"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:0000069a:text","row":39391,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"家庭の事情が。","en":"Family circumstances.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904099","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00019","en":"Family circumstances.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:000006c8:text","row":39392,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「昨夜のアレ、本気か？」","en":"“Were you serious about that thing last night?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904100","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00020","en":"Taichi: \"That thing last evening, you serious?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:0000077e:text","row":39393,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「ん？」","en":"“Hm?”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904101","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00021","en":"Tomoki: \"Hm?\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:000007a6:text","row":39394,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「食料問題を友貴が仕切るって」","en":"“About you taking charge of our food.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904102","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00022","en":"Taichi: \"When you said that you'll take care of the food problem.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000862:text","row":39395,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「ああ、午後から動くよ。学校にはちょっと様子見に来ただけだし」","en":"“Yeah. I'll get started this afternoon. I only stopped by the school to see how things were.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904103","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00023","en":"Tomoki: \"Yeah, I'll be getting to work after noon. I just came to school to see how's things a bit.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar"],"assessment":"The embedded clause requires statement word order and plural agreement.","remedy":"to see how things are","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":92,"start":73,"text":"to see how's things"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:000008c0:text","row":39396,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「食料か」","en":"“Food, huh.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904104","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00024","en":"Taichi: \"Food, right.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:000008e2:text","row":39397,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"必要ないものだ。","en":"We didn't need it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904105","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00025","en":"It's something unnecessary,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:0000090a:text","row":39398,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"どうせ一週間で世界は公転。","en":"The world would complete another revolution in a week anyway.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904106","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00026","en":"for the world will be revolving in one week regardless.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:0000093c:text","row":39399,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"仮に死んでも、取り返しはつく。","en":"Even death could be undone.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904107","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00027","en":"Even supposing there's death, there will be recovery.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:0000097a:text","row":39400,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“……”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904108","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00028","en":"Taichi: \"...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:0000099a:text","row":39401,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"ざわりと。心が。","en":"Something stirred uneasily in my heart.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904109","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00029","en":"Discomfort. In the heart.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:000009c2:text","row":39402,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"いかん……。","en":"This was bad...","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904110","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00030","en":"Cut it out...","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:000009e6:text","row":39403,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"気を静めないと。","en":"I had to calm myself down.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904111","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00031","en":"For if I can't calm myself...","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The narrator tells himself that he must calm down. The English creates an unfinished conditional about being unable to do so and adds a causal connector.","remedy":"I have to calm myself down.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":29,"start":0,"text":"For if I can't calm myself..."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000a16:text","row":39404,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「友情は見返りを」","en":"“Friendship asks for nothing—”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904112","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00032","en":"Taichi: \"Friendship demands...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000ac6:text","row":39405,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「求めない」","en":"“—in return.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904113","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00033","en":"Tomoki: \"Nothing in return.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000aea:text","row":39406,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"ぐっ","en":"Thumbs-up.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904114","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00034","en":"Tahm!","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000b06:text","row":39407,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"俺たちは親指を立てた。","en":"We gave each other a thumbs-up.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904115","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00035","en":"We stuck our thumbs up.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000bba:text","row":39408,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"「……だから唐突」","en":"“...And that came completely out of nowhere.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904116","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00036","en":"Tomoki: \"...what's that all of a sudden.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000bec:text","row":39409,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"「なあ友貴」","en":"“Hey, Tomoki.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904117","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00037","en":"Tomoki: \"Say, Tomoki.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["name_address","presentation"],"assessment":"Taichi addresses Tomoki. The English labels Tomoki as the speaker, making him address himself by name.","remedy":"Taichi: \"Hey, Tomoki.\"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":22,"start":0,"text":"Tomoki: \"Say, Tomoki.\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000c96:text","row":39410,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"「ん？」","en":"“Hm?”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904118","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00038","en":"Tomoki: \"Hm?\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000cbe:text","row":39411,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"「みみ先輩と……ケンカしてるよな？」","en":"“You and Mimi...you're fighting, right?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904119","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00039","en":"Taichi: \"You're... fighting with Mimi-senpai, right?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000d1f:text","row":39412,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"「ああ……」","en":"“Yeah...”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904120","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00040","en":"Tomoki: \"Yeah...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000d4b:text","row":39413,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"「あれって、やっぱこんなご時世でも、続くのかな？」","en":"“Will that really keep going, even now—with the world like this?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904121","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00041","en":"Taichi: \"And is that going to go on even when the times are like this?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000dba:text","row":39414,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"「……別に」","en":"“...Whatever.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904122","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00042","en":"Tomoki: \"...not really.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000dde:text","row":39415,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"翳(かげ)る。","en":"His face darkened.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904123","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00043","en":"Darkening.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000e27:text","row":39416,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"「どうだっていいよ、あの人のことは」","en":"“I don't care what happens to her.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904124","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00044","en":"Tomoki: \"I don't give a damn about that person there.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000e63:text","row":39417,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"頑なな言葉。","en":"His words were unyielding.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904125","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00045","en":"Stubborn words.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000e8f:text","row":39418,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"「マンガとかじゃ、そーいう諍いからいろいろ崩壊したりするんだけど」","en":"“In manga, fights like that are usually where everything starts falling apart.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904126","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00046","en":"Taichi: \"With manga and the like we've had quarrels that have led to all sorts of downfalls, though.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition","logical_relation"],"assessment":"Taichi says that in manga, quarrels like this can make all sorts of things fall apart. The English says the speakers themselves have had such ruinous quarrels.","remedy":"in manga, quarrels like that can make everything fall apart","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":91,"start":33,"text":"we've had quarrels that have led to all sorts of downfalls"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0294:00000f4a:text","row":39419,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"友貴はひどく、渋い顔をした。","en":"Tomoki gave me a deeply sour look.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904127","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008a:00047","en":"Tomoki made a grim, sullen face.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
